// Test conversation for the sandbox map.
=== start
[flag sandbox_met] -> again
~ set sandbox_met
The old man squints at you. "Bandits by the river. Two of them. Took my grandson's spear."
* [speech 30] "I'll get it back. What's it worth to you?" -> reward
* "Show me what you've got to trade." -> trade
* "Not my problem." -> END

=== again
"Back again? The bandits are still out there."
* "Trade." -> trade
* "Bye." -> END

=== reward
"Twenty silver, all I have." He means it.
~ quest sandbox_spear get_spear
* "Done." -> END

=== trade
~ barter
"Look all you like."
* "Thanks." -> END
